# Auto-generated HTMXObjects recording outputs — not committed to main
docs/src/public/live-*/

# (Formerly auto-installed by HTMXObjects.vitepress_theme_install during
# make.jl. Now committed in-tree because HTMXObjects.jl is private and
# CI has no PAT_TOKEN to clone it. Re-sync manually when needed.)

# Local byte-identity golden baseline (regenerated via `julia test/golden_awm.jl capture`)
*.jls

# Third-party datasets the BRM catalogue benchmark downloads on demand. NOT
# vendored: the data belongs to its upstream (Rdatasets, pymc-examples), and
# checking it in would make this repository a redistributor of it. The runner
# records each file's source URL and sha256 in the artifact instead, so a rerun
# that silently picked up different data is still detectable.
docs/benchmark/brm/data/
